{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/extras/955591fc4f00dc02668da8ff278508e5.poster.avif?t=1755116858\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/extras/955591fc4f00dc02668da8ff278508e5.webm?t=1755116858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/extras/955591fc4f00dc02668da8ff278508e5.mp4?t=1755116858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JUMP INTO THE CHAOS \u2013 PLAY FOR FREE! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your friends and dive into the ultimate multiplayer party battle royale! Race, stumble, and battle it out in hilarious obstacle courses where only one player can become the winner - will it be you?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>32-PLAYER MULTIPLAYER ONLINE MADNESS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against up to 32 players in fast-paced, chaotic matches and tournaments. Can you dodge, jump, and stumble your way to victory?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/extras/21c1dff8383138f8c13de07b4e9a4da1.poster.avif?t=1755116858\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/extras/21c1dff8383138f8c13de07b4e9a4da1.webm?t=1755116858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/extras/21c1dff8383138f8c13de07b4e9a4da1.mp4?t=1755116858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY TOURNAMENTS &amp; CLIMB THE RANKED LEADERBOARD\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, clash, kick and fall to survive in tournaments and collect points to climb the Ranked leaderboard and unlock cool rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60+ COOL MAPS, ENDLESS FUN!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed through insane obstacle courses, dodge crazy traps, and outplay your rivals! With over 60 maps packed with challenges, every match is a new adventure.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR STUMBLER \u2013 THOUSANDS OF COSMETICS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock epic skins, hilarious emotes, and more to stand out from the crowd. Become a ninja, superhero, or even a chicken, there\u2019s a style for everyone. Collect them all and show them off!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/extras/12daac30d542a385761fb236ff2c99d1.poster.avif?t=1755116858\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/extras/12daac30d542a385761fb236ff2c99d1.webm?t=1755116858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/extras/12daac30d542a385761fb236ff2c99d1.mp4?t=1755116858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LIMITED-TIME EVENTS &amp; AWESOME CROSSOVERS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into special events playing the best game modes like Floor is Lava and Banana Bonanza or expand your collection with legendary stumblers from SpongeBob, My Hero Academia, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CROSS-PLAY ON STEAM &amp; MOBILE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play anywhere, anytime! Stumble Guys is free to play and supports cross-play between Steam and mobile, so you can battle your friends no matter where they are!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready to stumble? Download now and join the fun!</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Champion!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1677740/34fe5348513bee5556fd08094baaa72ae49d9421.jpg"},{"name":"Battler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1677740/d5402e1c6f96ad04fbf914ed4f4209dd2e581231.jpg"},{"name":"Trophy Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1677740/667e58a3ebed20584e19bc0664554d7369273af9.jpg"},{"name":"I See Stars","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1677740/78f492304a131c799940d16784d937acfb507130.jpg"},{"name":"Leveling Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1677740/1e77da9fd41a69b118429b39b6d01635deb7b49d.jpg"},{"name":"Stand Out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1677740/289549ae11d7496b7a285108209dd0c6c042e514.jpg"},{"name":":) :P","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1677740/9542a68797abfe53738b1a874319e63add913de3.jpg"},{"name":"Show Off","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1677740/f8e478e2a8b7b5aeca4442882ec64561fee99846.jpg"},{"name":"Eat My Dust","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1677740/77d0b7bf6640032a3c31221a72d746021f54c024.jpg"},{"name":"Express Yourself","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1677740/4c6518fcb695fc6b033eeb3c3cd6fbe82ca29f4d.jpg"}],"total":36},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1677740?t=1755116858","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755116858","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755116858","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755116858","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/extras/955591fc4f00dc02668da8ff278508e5.poster.avif?t=1755116858\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/extras/955591fc4f00dc02668da8ff278508e5.webm?t=1755116858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/extras/955591fc4f00dc02668da8ff278508e5.mp4?t=1755116858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JUMP INTO THE CHAOS \u2013 PLAY FOR FREE! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your friends and dive into the ultimate multiplayer party battle royale! Race, stumble, and battle it out in hilarious obstacle courses where only one player can become the winner - will it be you?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>32-PLAYER MULTIPLAYER ONLINE MADNESS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against up to 32 players in fast-paced, chaotic matches and tournaments. Can you dodge, jump, and stumble your way to victory?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/extras/21c1dff8383138f8c13de07b4e9a4da1.poster.avif?t=1755116858\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/extras/21c1dff8383138f8c13de07b4e9a4da1.webm?t=1755116858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/extras/21c1dff8383138f8c13de07b4e9a4da1.mp4?t=1755116858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY TOURNAMENTS &amp; CLIMB THE RANKED LEADERBOARD\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, clash, kick and fall to survive in tournaments and collect points to climb the Ranked leaderboard and unlock cool rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60+ COOL MAPS, ENDLESS FUN!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed through insane obstacle courses, dodge crazy traps, and outplay your rivals! With over 60 maps packed with challenges, every match is a new adventure.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR STUMBLER \u2013 THOUSANDS OF COSMETICS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock epic skins, hilarious emotes, and more to stand out from the crowd. Become a ninja, superhero, or even a chicken, there\u2019s a style for everyone. Collect them all and show them off!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/extras/12daac30d542a385761fb236ff2c99d1.poster.avif?t=1755116858\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/extras/12daac30d542a385761fb236ff2c99d1.webm?t=1755116858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/extras/12daac30d542a385761fb236ff2c99d1.mp4?t=1755116858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LIMITED-TIME EVENTS &amp; AWESOME CROSSOVERS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into special events playing the best game modes like Floor is Lava and Banana Bonanza or expand your collection with legendary stumblers from SpongeBob, My Hero Academia, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CROSS-PLAY ON STEAM &amp; MOBILE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play anywhere, anytime! Stumble Guys is free to play and supports cross-play between Steam and mobile, so you can battle your friends no matter where they are!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready to stumble? Download now and join the fun!</strong></p>","developers":["Scopely"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677740/header.jpg?t=1755116858","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1677740/761367/39b8bccd37d2f760f0cfffbb47d49073645db8df/1756426944/dash_av1.mpd?t=1727297788","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1677740/761367/39b8bccd37d2f760f0cfffbb47d49073645db8df/1756426944/dash_h264.mpd?t=1727297788","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1677740/761367/39b8bccd37d2f760f0cfffbb47d49073645db8df/1756426944/hls_264_master.m3u8?t